From: AEON-7 <aeon-7@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 19:02:02 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 6/6] [ROCm][Inkling2] AEON research hooks: weight overlay,
 activation capture, runtime o_proj ablation

Original AEON work. All hooks are off unless their AEON_* variable is set.

- AEON_WEIGHT_OVERLAY: overlay safetensors replace checkpoint tensors of
  the same name at load (e.g. layers.N.attn.wo_ud.weight), so edited
  o_proj variants serve without copying the checkpoint.
- AEON_CAPTURE_DIR / _APPS / _WHAT: per layer application (0..47, looped
  layers counted per pass) dump of the stream entering the next
  application and the o_proj input/output at the last prefill row of each
  request, with positions and last prompt ids for matching.
- AEON_ABLATE: per-application rank-1 edit of the o_proj output,
  y - s_a r_a (r_a . y), the runtime form of W = (I - s r r^T) W with a
  separate scale per loop pass.

Signed-off-by: AEON-7 <aeon-7@users.noreply.github.com>
